54	    servable_len: Option<u32>,
55	    /// KV pool capacity in blocks + block size, or `None` if the engine did not
56	    /// report it. See [`KvCapacity`].
57	    kv_capacity: Option<KvCapacity>,
58	    /// One optional live-load feed per scheduler partition. A normal engine
59	    /// has one partition; a data-parallel engine exposes one per logical DP
